        },
        "description": "The niece of the [Duke of Normandy](https://anilist.co/character/123069/Duke-of-Normandy) and a princess of Albion Kingdom who is fourth in the line of succession for the throne. She has an oddball personality, but she gets along well with others.\n\n~!She knew [Ange](https://anilist.co/character/122800/le-Carr-Ange) from ten years ago. She works with Ange in hopes that she will help her ascend to the throne. Princess's true name is Ange.!~\n\n~!During episode 9 it is revealed that Ange, the current \"Princess\" was switched with the real princess when the revolution started. Thus, she had to learn all the etiquette and mannerisms of being a princess on her own and adopted the role of \"princess\" in place of Charlotte.!~",
